# Database Schema

PostgreSQL via Prisma. All tenant-owned models include `tenantId`.

## Core Models

| Model | Key Fields | Notes |
|-------|-----------|-------|
| Tenant | id, name, slug, subscriptionPlan | Root isolation boundary |
| Store | id, tenantId, name, address, timezone | Physical location |
| Table | id, storeId, name, qrCode, active | QR links to store + table |
| Category | id, storeId, name, sortOrder | Menu grouping |
| Product | id, categoryId, name, description, price, image, available | |
| ProductVariant | id, productId, name, priceModifier | Small/Medium/Large |
| Order | id, tenantId, storeId, tableId, status, subtotal, total | |
| OrderItem | id, orderId, productId, variantId, quantity, price | Snapshot price at order time |

## Conventions

- Use `cuid()` or `uuid()` for IDs consistently
- Index `tenantId` on all tenant-scoped tables
- Index `storeId` on orders for KDS queries
- Enum `OrderStatus`: `NEW | PREPARING | READY | FULFILLED | CANCELLED`
